	"notice": "Select MIDI state using the switch in the battery compartment; HID state is separate. The BT button selects channel 1 or 2. FX mode sends CC12/13, loop mode CC82/83, music mode CC1/64, and metronome mode sends clock start/stop. These are outgoing controller messages; the profile does not present them as incoming remote controls. Exact browser port names are unverified; select this profile manually. Diagrams show selected physical controls schematically, not a complete panel inventory. Unbound controls do not imply fixed MIDI assignments.",
